      "section": "REQUEST FOR A PLANNED DEVELOPMENT AMENDMENT",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "A motion was made by Planning Commission Member Rogers to recommend approval of the request to amend an approved PD-C (Planned Development Commercial) on approximately .93 acres, located at 1664 S Dixie Drive for the purpose of building an athletic club, dance school, health fitness and events studio. Providing the applicant does not need put the 6’ wall on this property, with staff’s two recommendations and not insert the word “events” into the Dixie Commons PD-C, potential events could operate under standard business practices, and any special events would come to the City for permit.",
